        "title": "Specifications",
        "heading_size": "h4",
        "content": "<p>Created for a select group of collectors worldwide, the GOAT Collector Trio Set combines rarity, provenance, and sporting significance at a level unlikely to be repeated.</p><p>A collector's opportunity.</p><p>A champion's legacy.</p><p>Only Three sets Ever. Worldwide.<br/></p>",
