        "richtext_NT7QmM": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Each piece is individually hand-signed, officially licensed by the Argentina Football Association, and permanently numbered.</p><p>Only three collectors worldwide will ever have the opportunity to own this piece.<br/></p><p>The Golden Ball represents football immortality.<br/> The Golden Glove represents composure under pressure.<br/> The Golden Boot represents movement, hunger, and legacy.</p><p>Designed as the ultimate centrepiece for serious collectors, the Trinity Set captures the complete identity of a world champion generation in one unified display.</p><p>Extremely limited. Individually numbered. Created for the chosen few.</p>",
